  Description		  "ANEYE / NetraAI Digital Twin V6. Primary and recapture acquisition traffic are merged using a SimEve"
  "nts Path Combiner. Route-5 cases consume recapture preparation, a second fundus capture and a second AI pass. Recapt"
  "ure cases exit after the second AI pass; post-recapture clinical outcome is not inferred."
